      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Actively developed – major feature and free content updates planned!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>gogh: Focus with Your Avatar</strong> is a <strong>multiplayer online focus game for work.</strong> Customize your ideal workspace and cute avatars, gather in each other’s rooms, and focus together. Timers and To-Dos, lo-fi music, and beautiful ambience make desk work more fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“MULTIPLAYER ONLINE FOCUS ROOMS” FOR UP TO 16 PEOPLE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Publish the workspace you built—or drop into someone else’s—and work with friends and players worldwide. To protect focus there’s <strong>no chat</strong> in multiplayer: declare what you’re working on, say hi with emotes, and watch study/work become more fun and productive together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213850/extras/d0a68a2ae1efcc25ffbfea89ca3fcdf5.poster.avif?t=1771042976\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213850/extras/d0a68a2ae1efcc25ffbfea89ca3fcdf5.webm?t=1771042976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213850/extras/d0a68a2ae1efcc25ffbfea89ca3fcdf5.mp4?t=1771042976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR OWN ROOM TO PERSONALIZE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a space that’s uniquely yours, arranging furniture, decor, and colors however you like. Add your favorite images or GIFs to monitors, posters, and other room items, so every corner feels just right. Save different setups and switch things up anytime to match your vibe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213850/extras/f3dee3381bebb8f48f63a0ed8dcc82dd.poster.avif?t=1771042976\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213850/extras/f3dee3381bebb8f48f63a0ed8dcc82dd.webm?t=1771042976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213850/extras/f3dee3381bebb8f48f63a0ed8dcc82dd.mp4?t=1771042976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADORABLE ANIME-STYLE AVATARS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your avatar with a variety of face parts, hairstyles, and outfits to make them the perfect little sidekick for your work sessions. Move them around, pick animations, and sync with the Pomodoro timer as they shift between focus and relaxation along with you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213850/extras/8cd531aeecaf9f34209553a7c365cebf.poster.avif?t=1771042976\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213850/extras/8cd531aeecaf9f34209553a7c365cebf.webm?t=1771042976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213850/extras/8cd531aeecaf9f34209553a7c365cebf.mp4?t=1771042976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A QUIRKY COMPANION TO CHEER YOU ON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay on track with the simple To-Do list and Pomodoro timer, while uncovering new forms of your quirky companion as you make progress, keeping you curious and motivated! Who knew productivity could feel so rewarding?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213850/extras/dabd4753ac39c00171253a552c71906f.poster.avif?t=1771042976\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213850/extras/dabd4753ac39c00171253a552c71906f.webm?t=1771042976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213850/extras/dabd4753ac39c00171253a552c71906f.mp4?t=1771042976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHILL LOFI BEATS AND AMBIENT SOUNDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax with playlists featuring chill Lofi beats from “Japanolofi Records” and ambient sounds you can mix to suit your mood. With ASMR-like sounds synced to your avatar’s actions—typing, writing, or page-turning—you’ll be surrounded by the perfect atmosphere to stay focused and unwind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mac SUPPORT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with Apple Silicon Macs. The perfect companion for your Mac work sessions!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pomodoro, count-up, and countdown timers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To-Do list</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Habit tracker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work/focus stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stream-safe focus BGM (some playlists excluded)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambient sounds with on/off and per-sound volume controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Room customization with granular placement of furniture and props</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attach images/GIFs to room items; stream content (e.g., via OBS) onto in-room screens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Furnished” mode and “Creative” mode (build from scratch)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save multiple rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Publish your room and join others (multiplayer)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather &amp; time-of-day switching; indoor lighting on/off and brightness control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-camera mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avatar customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save multiple avatars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place multiple avatars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photo mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise <strong>Kuroda 42</strong>, a mysterious creature that grows in real time</p></li></ul>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Actively developed – major feature and free content updates planned!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>gogh: Focus with Your Avatar</strong> is a <strong>multiplayer online focus game for work.</strong> Customize your ideal workspace and cute avatars, gather in each other’s rooms, and focus together. Timers and To-Dos, lo-fi music, and beautiful ambience make desk work more fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“MULTIPLAYER ONLINE FOCUS ROOMS” FOR UP TO 16 PEOPLE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Publish the workspace you built—or drop into someone else’s—and work with friends and players worldwide. To protect focus there’s <strong>no chat</strong> in multiplayer: declare what you’re working on, say hi with emotes, and watch study/work become more fun and productive together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213850/extras/d0a68a2ae1efcc25ffbfea89ca3fcdf5.poster.avif?t=1771042976\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213850/extras/d0a68a2ae1efcc25ffbfea89ca3fcdf5.webm?t=1771042976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213850/extras/d0a68a2ae1efcc25ffbfea89ca3fcdf5.mp4?t=1771042976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR OWN ROOM TO PERSONALIZE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a space that’s uniquely yours, arranging furniture, decor, and colors however you like. Add your favorite images or GIFs to monitors, posters, and other room items, so every corner feels just right. Save different setups and switch things up anytime to match your vibe!</p>